The common-output/replay design and parts of the Limen, Backtrader,
backtesting.py and vectorbt adapters are adapted from:

https://github.com/Vaquum/Limen/tree/29837e666604eee74a2ac94f328fb9803724342a/tests/backtest_benchmark

The benchmark here changes signal availability/lag, extends the cash/quantity
oracle, separates full-engine and diagnostic scopes, and introduces independent
process repetitions and an untimed preflight admission step.

